sequenceDiagram
  participant C as MCP client
  participant T as /mcp or stdio transport
  participant W as withMetrics + withTrace
  participant H as tool handler
  participant A as checkAuthorization
  participant B as BlackboardClient
  participant L as Blackboard Learn

  C->>T: tools/call (name, arguments incl. caller_identity)
  T->>W: dispatch to handler
  W->>H: start trace (request id, latency)
  H->>A: parseIdentity, then authorize
  A->>A: per-role rate limit
  A->>A: FERPA gate on restricted tools
  A->>A: RBAC role check (deny by default)
  A-->>H: access.granted or access.denied (audit entry)
  H->>B: fetch data
  B->>L: GET with cached OAuth2 token
  L-->>B: JSON or HTTP error
  B-->>H: data or mapped error category
  H-->>W: tool result
  W->>W: scrub emails from output
  W-->>C: content (text JSON)
